{"symbol":"CRI.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T23:07:12Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Jana Pawla II 66","city":"Piaseczno","zip":"05-500","country":"Poland","phone":"48 22 246 4575","fax":"48 22 233 10 27","website":"https://www.creotech.pl","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","industryKey":"aerospace-defense","industryDisp":"Aerospace & Defense","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Creotech Instruments S.A. engages in the manufacture and sale of satellites, satellite systems, and subsystems in Poland. The company offers satellites, such as Nano MR MS, Eagle HR MS, and Seagull HR SAR; platforms, including HyperSat Nano, HyperSat Eagle, and custom solutions; and various services comprising mission analysis and design, registration, insurance, launch, operations, data warehousing, processing, and advanced data analysis services. It also provides science products, such as Sinara/ARTIQ, MTCA/µTCA, White Rabbit by Creotech, standalone, FMC, and DI/OT, as well as controller, digital analog converter, analog digital converter, direct digital synthesizer, amplifier, delay, arbitrary waveform generator, digital input output, extension card, carrier, switch, PCIe board, and other products. In addition, the company offers CreoScan portable Ground Stations; Flight Monitoring System, a situational awareness system; Drone Rapid Mapping system, an integrated hardware and software solution; customized services; SAMPLE system which is used for the automated detection and monitoring of terrain obstacles; and Geomatic Remote Eye, a system which enables the collection of elevation data for given points or geographical areas. Further, it provides manufacturing services comprising full assembly for production of PCB, components, and blueprints; SMT and THT assembly; vacuum soldering; automatic optical and xray inspection; PCB cleaning; selective application of protective coatings; final assembly; press fit assembly; technical consulting and testing; traceability of individual devices from a batch; production of cable harnesses; and climatic research services. Creotech Instruments S.A. was founded in 2008 and is headquartered in Piaseczno, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":297,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Grzegorz  Brona Ph.D.","title":"President of the Management Board & CEO","fiscalYear":2023,"totalPay":494048,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Pawel  Gornicki Ph.D.","title":"Vice-President of the Management Board & CFO","fiscalYear":2023,"totalPay":270000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Jacek  Mandas","title":"Vice President of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2023,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Maciej  Misiura","title":"Vice President of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2023,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Jakub  Bochinski Ph.D.","title":"Vice President of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2023,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1703980800,"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":780,"open":788,"dayLow":759,"dayHigh":793,"regularMarketPreviousClose":780,"regularMarketOpen":788,"regularMarketDayLow":759,"regularMarketDayHigh":793,"dividendYield":0,"payoutRatio":0,"beta":0.59,"trailingPE":125.248,"volume":10171,"regularMarketVolume":10171,"averageVolume":9895,"averageVolume10days":8209,"averageDailyVolume10Day":8209,"bid":759,"ask":766,"marketCap":2166449408,"nonDilutedMarketCap":2733390660,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":343.5,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1086,"allTimeHigh":1086,"allTimeLow":71.2,"fulldayPrice":759,"fulldayChange":-21,"fulldayChangePercent":-2.69231,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":12.7169,"fiftyDayAverage":788.94,"twoHundredDayAverage":731.295,"trailingAnnualDividendRate":0,"trailingAnnualDividendYield":0,"currency":"PLN","tradeable":false,"enterpriseValue":2161077248,"forwardPE":41.2131,"pro